{"seq":1,"slug":"action-mapping","title":"动作映射系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/mapping/action-mapping","wordCount":1560,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"动作映射系统\">动作映射系统</h1><p>把 <code>if (Input.GetKey(KeyCode.W)) moveForward()</code> 撒满代码，是新手输入代码的标志性气味。它把&quot;哪个物理键&quot;和&quot;要做什么&quot;焊死在一起，于是支持手柄要改一遍、让玩家改键改不了、同一个键在菜单里也触发移动。动作映射系统（action mapping）用一个间接层根治这一切：游戏逻辑只认&quot;前进&quot;这个<strong>动作</strong>，物理绑定是动作的可替换数据。这是整个映射章的地基，也是输入系统从&quot;能跑&quot;到&quot;工程化&quot;的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动作映射在物理输入和游戏逻辑之间插入一个间接层。<strong>动作</strong>（action）是游戏逻辑关心的语义意图，如&quot;跳跃&quot;&quot;移动&quot;&quot;瞄准&quot;；<strong>绑定</strong>（binding）是把一个或多个物理控件连到某动作的数据。逻辑只订阅动作，绑定可以随平台、随玩家偏好任意替换，而逻辑一行不改。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[物理控件&lt;br/&gt;键W / 手柄左摇杆 / 触屏摇杆] --&gt; B[绑定表&lt;br/&gt;控件 to 动作]&#10;  B --&gt; C{动作类型}&#10;  C --&gt;|按钮型| D[Jump: bool 边沿]&#10;  C --&gt;|轴型| E[Throttle: float 0..1]&#10;  C --&gt;|矢量型| F[Move: Vector2]&#10;  D --&gt; G[游戏逻辑&lt;br/&gt;只认动作名]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[物理控件&lt;br/&gt;键W / 手柄左摇杆 / 触屏摇杆] --&gt; B[绑定表&lt;br/&gt;控件 to 动作]\n  B --&gt; C{动作类型}\n  C --&gt;|按钮型| D[Jump: bool 边沿]\n  C --&gt;|轴型| E[Throttle: float 0..1]\n  C --&gt;|矢量型| F[Move: Vector2]\n  D --&gt; G[游戏逻辑&lt;br/&gt;只认动作名]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>动作不是铁板一块，按值类型分三类，处理方式各异。下表是设计动作时的分类依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作类型</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>处理要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按钮型（button）</td>\n<td>bool / 边沿</td>\n<td>键、手柄按钮、触屏按钮</td>\n<td>跳跃、开火、交互</td>\n<td>关心 pressed/released 边沿与 held 时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轴型（axis / value）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>扳机、单轴</td>\n<td>油门、刹车、缩放</td>\n<td>死区、灵敏度曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矢量型（vector）</td>\n<td>Vector2</td>\n<td>摇杆、WASD 合成、触屏摇杆</td>\n<td>移动、瞄准方向</td>\n<td>圆形死区、归一化、对角线处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把动作分类清楚，绑定逻辑才不会乱：用 WASD 四个键合成一个 Move 矢量，和用左摇杆直接给 Move 矢量，对上层是同一个动作，但绑定层的合成方式完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复合绑定与控件合成\">复合绑定与控件合成</h2><p>矢量型动作最能体现绑定层的工作量。键盘没有摇杆，但 WASD 四个按钮可以<strong>复合</strong>（composite）成一个二维矢量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mtext>normalize</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>right</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>left</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>up</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>down</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v} = \\text{normalize}\\big((\\,d_{\\text{right}}-d_{\\text{left}},\\ d_{\\text{up}}-d_{\\text{down}}\\,)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">normalize</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">right</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">left</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">up</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">down</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是对应键的 0/1 状态。归一化很关键——否则同时按&quot;上+右&quot;会得到长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.41</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2}\\approx 1.41</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.41</span></span></span></span></span> 的矢量，斜向移动比直行快 41%，这是无数早期游戏的经典 bug。摇杆则相反：它本就给出连续矢量，但需要圆形死区裁掉中心漂移，且不应再归一化（否则丢失&quot;推多远走多快&quot;的模拟量）。</p>\n<p>Unity 的 Input System 用 <code>2DVector</code> composite 内置了 WASD 合成；Unreal 的 Enhanced Input 用 Input Modifiers（如 <code>Swizzle</code>、<code>Negate</code>）和 Input Triggers 把这类变换数据化。其设计哲学一致：<strong>绑定层做几何与归一化，上层动作只收一个干净的 Vector2</strong>。复合还能反向用于按钮——&quot;长按 X 秒触发&quot;或&quot;双击触发&quot;也是绑定层的触发器，让一个物理键产生多个语义动作。复合绑定落到代码上就是&quot;读多个源控件、按规则合成、输出一个动作值&quot;，矢量合成本质是一段纯函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct Binding { ControlId src; float scale; };   // scale 用于取反或缩放&#10;&#10;// 四个方向键 → 一个 Move 矢量&#10;Vector2 readMove(const std::vector&lt;Binding&gt;&amp; b, const ControlMap&amp; m) {&#10;    Vector2 v{0.f, 0.f};&#10;    for (const auto&amp; bind : b) v += m.value(bind.src) * bind.scale;  // A:-1, D:+1, S:-1, W:+1&#10;    if (v.length() &gt; 1.f) v = v.normalized();   // 防斜向超速（长度 ≤ 1）&#10;    else if (v.length() &lt; kStickDeadzone) v = {}; // 圆形死区，中心不响应&#10;    return v;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 长按触发器：物理键 → 语义动作（延迟兑现）&#10;bool readHold(const ButtonState&amp; s, float heldFor, float threshold) {&#10;    return s.down &amp;&amp; heldFor &gt;= threshold;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Binding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ControlId src; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scale; };</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // scale 用于取反或缩放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 四个方向键 → 一个 Move 矢量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vector2</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readMove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Binding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ControlMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vector2 v{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> auto&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bind : b) v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bind.src) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bind.scale;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // A:-1, D:+1, S:-1, W:+1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">normalized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 防斜向超速（长度 ≤ 1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kStickDeadzone) v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 圆形死区，中心不响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 长按触发器：物理键 → 语义动作（延迟兑现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readHold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> heldFor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.down </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heldFor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>scale</code> 让&quot;W 与 S 合成同一轴的反向&quot;用同一套绑定表表达，无需两个动作；归一化与死区则保证上层收到的永远是合法矢量。触发器同理，只是把&quot;值&quot;换成&quot;满足时序条件的布尔&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一对多与多对一\">一对多与多对一</h2><p>动作与控件不是一一对应。一个动作常<strong>绑多个控件</strong>（键 + 手柄 + 触屏同时映射到 Jump，玩家用哪个都行）；一个控件也可能在不同上下文映射到<strong>不同动作</strong>（X 键战斗中是攻击、载具中是喇叭）——后者由 <a href=\"input-contexts\">输入上下文与栈</a> 管理。设计时要区分这两种多义性，它们的解法不同：一对多是绑定表里同一动作的多条绑定，运行时取或（任一触发即触发）；多对一是上下文切换，同一控件的绑定随上下文整组替换。</p>\n<p>还有一类微妙情况是<strong>互斥与优先级</strong>。同时按下&quot;左&quot;和&quot;右&quot;该如何？常见策略是&quot;后按优先&quot;（SOCD，simultaneous opposing cardinal directions，格斗游戏对此有严格规则）或&quot;清零&quot;。这类决策属于绑定/合成层，不应泄漏到上层逻辑——上层只该收到一个明确的方向，而非自己处理矛盾输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引擎实践与数据驱动\">引擎实践与数据驱动</h2><p>动作映射的价值在于把绑定做成<strong>数据而非代码</strong>。Unity 用 <code>.inputactions</code> 资产（一个可视编辑的 JSON），Unreal 用 Input Mapping Context 与 Input Action 资产，二者都让设计师在编辑器里改绑定、加平台变体，无需碰代码。这带来三个直接收益：玩家重绑定成为可能（见 <a href=\"rebinding-config\">重绑定与配置</a>）、多平台绑定各存一份、绑定改动不触发重编译。</p>\n<p>落地时有几个工程原则。其一，<strong>动作命名按意图不按设备</strong>——叫 <code>Interact</code> 而非 <code>PressE</code>，否则间接层白做。其二，动作交付要走统一接口（轮询当前值或订阅事件回调，见 <a href=\"../foundations/polling-vs-events\">轮询与事件</a> 的逐动作选型），gameplay 不直接碰设备。其三，动作触发之后的事——比如这个动作要释放哪个技能、走哪个冷却——不属于本系统，属于 <a href=\"../../gameplay-ability-systems/systems-depth/ability-input-binding\">玩法技能系统的输入绑定</a>；动作映射只负责把干净的语义动作交付出去，到此为止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>动作映射用&quot;动作&quot;间接层解耦物理绑定与游戏逻辑，逻辑只认语义动作，绑定随平台/玩家可替换。</li>\n<li>动作分按钮型、轴型、矢量型三类，值类型不同、处理不同；矢量合成必须归一化以免斜向超速。</li>\n<li>绑定层负责复合（WASD 合成矢量）、死区、灵敏度、触发器等几何与时序变换，上层只收干净值。</li>\n<li>区分一对多（同动作多绑定取或）与多对一（同控件随上下文换动作），二者解法不同；矛盾输入在绑定层消解。</li>\n<li>用数据驱动资产（Unity <code>.inputactions</code>、Unreal IMC/IA）把绑定做成数据，动作按意图命名，交付到此为止。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本篇是 <a href=\"input-contexts\">输入上下文与栈</a> 与 <a href=\"rebinding-config\">重绑定与配置</a> 的前提，其值类型源自 <a href=\"../foundations/device-abstraction\">设备抽象层</a>，交付方式取决于 <a href=\"../foundations/polling-vs-events\">轮询与事件</a>。跨库见 <a href=\"../../gameplay-ability-systems/systems-depth/ability-input-binding\">技能的输入绑定</a>，它接收本系统交付的动作来触发能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动作映射系统","id":"动作映射系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"复合绑定与控件合成","id":"复合绑定与控件合成"},{"level":2,"text":"一对多与多对一","id":"一对多与多对一"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎实践与数据驱动","id":"引擎实践与数据驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"轮询与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/foundations/polling-vs-events"},"next":{"title":"输入上下文与栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/mapping/input-contexts"}}